                    <English>No Vermiculite</English>
                    <French>Pas de Vermiculite</French>
                </Vermiculite>
            </Main>
            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <mainWalls>Adding insulation to the exposed concrete walls and the log walls will result in significant energy savings. Adding a minimum R-20 to the walls will be eligible for a Good Energy rebate. </mainWalls>
                <ceilings>Blown cellulose is affordable and simple to install. It will result in moderate energy savings</ceilings>
                <foundation>Increasing the insulation on the slab will increase the comfort of the home and result in energy savings. Again, adding R-20 or more will be eligible for a Good Energy rebate. </foundation>
                <HeatingSystem>Consider installing a cold climate air source haet pump. These units can be up to 300% efficient in cool temperatures and will result in less propane use. </HeatingSystem>
            </RURComments>
        </Options>
